ble shell, mandatory cooking, safe raw consumption, allergen absence or toxin absence. Inability to see inside does not establish that opening is required before eating. Resource labels, source maturity, successful gathering and availability of eat never certify safety. Optional evidenceRefs must resolve to complete records Moss actually knows; inaccessible or partial references are reported unavailable, not silently fetched or reconstructed. Any consultation requires a separate actual communication action and an independently acting participant; this assessment neither supplies another person's answer nor assumes consent.\\\\nOutputs are an immutable, dated personal assessment record with unique assessment ID, specimen ID, source binding, observed-state fingerprint, exact evidence references and uncertainty fields, plus an assessment-completed event only after commit. This is a real bounded observation/report product, not a food product, safety certificate or nutrition change. Original matter, quantity, ownership and location are unchanged; no shell, kernel, debris or additional item is created. Normal ageing continues. No specimen reservation persists after the atomic action. Progress is pending or committed, never partially successful: interruption/cancel/death before commit produces no assessment record or assessment charge; completed work keeps its charge and report without refund. Study follows paid completed-round accounting, retaining completed progress without granting mastery before completion. Invalid attempts do not charge. No ongoing process, unattended observation, maintenance or automatic report refresh; a new observation requires another paid action. Development/review waiting advances no world time. Enforce eligibility, payments, reporting limits and event emission in code rather than repeated model approval.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Evaluate evidence gain separately from food function and visuals. Study, requests, registration, prerequisite lists and a printed implementation limitation earn zero. A genuinely new verified specimen observation, including a genuinely informative physical failure if one occurs within the permitted method, may invoke only the existing grounded-understanding rule: short amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8, cooldown 12, maintained gain 0.035 and decay 0.0015, subject to its actual implementation and personal applicability; if unavailable, award zero. Deduplicate canonically by specimen/property/state across this adapter and all equivalent inspections, not by ability name or report ID. Repeated unchanged rendering or unresolved safety reports earn nothing. No automatic comfort, satiety, health or satisfaction grant; basic nutrition and protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions remain untouched.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit reusable event metadata containing actorId=moss, exact specimenId, assessmentId when committed, source ability/revision, tick, phase, status and observed-state fingerprint. Reuse an actual inspection/record visual component if supported; otherwise provide a neutral inspection indicator driven by these events, without fabricating a world object. Pending, interrupted, invalid, completed-with-limited-evidence and completed-with-observations must be distinguishable. Completion means only that the paid assessment occurred, not that the specimen is safe. Render only actually supported exterior details and public action state; keep report contents private unless Moss later communicates them. No cutaway kernel, opening animation, food-ready badge, safety glow or success display for failed/uncompleted work. Reusable metadata and visuals themselves award no experience.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

